# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Tier-A 大文件防护 (2026-09-10 release-readiness pass)
# 防止 git add . 误将下列资产入库:
#   - database.tar: 157 MB 题库快照, 应走 GitHub Release assets
#   - hermes_pack/: 16 GB 历年中考真题 (题库已入库, raw 资源不入)
#   - lost_exam_pack_2026-09-10/: 672 MB 题库丢失数据
#   - database/incoming/: 1.6 GB staging 数据
#   - database/assets/: 183 MB 题图资产 (不入仓, 走对象存储)
#   - database/canonical/: 1.8 MB (allowlist EXCEPTION - 可入)
#   - database/preflight/: 824 KB (allowlist EXCEPTION - 可入)
#   - database/knowledge-points/ / question-bank/ / textbooks/ 已有顶层 ignore
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/database.tar
/hermes_pack/
/lost_exam_pack_2026-09-10/
/database/incoming/
/database/assets/
/database/backups/

# 但保留 canonical/ 与 preflight/ (manifest 数据)
/!database/canonical/
/!database/preflight/

